sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor System as Market / SIP Engine
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion API
    participant Kafka as Kafka: notification-events
    participant FreqCap as Redis Atomic Frequency Capping
    participant QuietHours as Timezone Quiet Hours Service
    participant Queue as Morning Quiet Hours Queue
    participant Dispatcher as Morning Digest Batch Dispatcher
    participant User as Recipient Client

    System->>Ingestion: POST /api/v1/events (MKTX-004 / SIPX-004)
    Ingestion->>Kafka: Stream standard event (Partition by user_id hash)
    Kafka->>FreqCap: Check Rolling User Cap (12/24h) & Same Event Cooldown (15m)
    alt Cap Exceeded
        FreqCap-->>Kafka: CAPPED: Suppress send, record audit metric
    else Cap Allowed
        FreqCap->>QuietHours: Evaluate Current Time in User's Timezone (21:00-08:00)
        alt In Quiet Hours Window
            QuietHours->>Queue: Enqueue NotificationRecord into Redis ZSET
            Note over Queue: Queued for Morning Dispatch (08:00)
            opt If >5 Notifications Accumulated
                Dispatcher->>User: Aggregate into Single Digest Summary at 08:00 AM
            end
        else Outside Quiet Hours
            QuietHours->>User: Immediate Dispatch to In-App / Push
        end
    end
